<title>USA: Comerica raises qtly dividend by 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Comerica raises qtly dividend by 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comerica Inc said Friday that its board of directors voted to increase the quarterly cash dividend by 10 percent to $0.43 a share from $0.39.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 1, 1997, to shareholders of record March 15, 1997.</p>
<p>Comerica is a bank holding company with subsidiaries in Michigan, California, Texas and Florida. It reported assets of $34 billion at September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
